欲しいです。営業時間外に忍び込んだので、二人以外には誰もいません。水遊びをしているところでもいいし、愛想を振りまいているところでもいいし、かわいいですよ。\n\n水着に着替えるのが面倒なので、できれば服を着ていてほしいですけど、それ以外は自由に着せてください。\n\nhttps://pin.it/3Y8egRF こちらを参考にしてください。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21xldbi66tcj", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@7kmr_GA/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2558951, "client_id": 193145, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2425cd86/uploads/origins/c5d6c6ad-57d9-44a7-8b99-6eceec063719?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff1bf255411cac12b300494cfdafa0fe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2425cd86/uploads/origins/c5d6c6ad-57d9-44a7-8b99-6eceec063719?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff1bf255411cac12b300494cfdafa0fe, https://si.imgix.net/2425cd86/uploads/origins/c5d6c6ad-57d9-44a7-8b99-6eceec063719?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8de3ac4f7cd53d516b4ea1ea1ce09fad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2425cd86/uploads/origins/c5d6c6ad-57d9-44a7-8b99-6eceec063719?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5e366df1725ce0533562fcf198c8ba9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2425cd86/uploads/origins/c5d6c6ad-57d9-44a7-8b99-6eceec063719?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e8a282b8beb2dfa3e5a8b54c4819913f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2425cd86/uploads/origins/c5d6c6ad-57d9-44a7-8b99-6eceec063719?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e8a282b8beb2dfa3e5a8b54c4819913f, https://si.imgix.net/2425cd86/uploads/origins/c5d6c6ad-57d9-44a7-8b99-6eceec063719?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b629a7146a6474dad901f8e96c19f356 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2425cd86/uploads/origins/c5d6c6ad-57d9-44a7-8b99-6eceec063719?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=169d04428274bdfa58d23528f77ede83 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして。\nあなたの絵は素敵だと思います。オリジナルキャラクター2体のイラストをお願いしたいです。リンク先をご参照ください。\n\nキャラクター\nキャラクターA 178cm。ふわふわの髪。高潔な旅の僧を気取っている美青年。実は妖怪を召喚して戦っている!一番頼りになるのは狐の精霊。自信家。\n\nキャラクターB 169cm。瞳はグレー。仕事の時はサングラスをかける。ダンサーでありながら、ある事件をきっかけに暗殺者になった。針小棒大に戦う。クールな女性。\n\n🤝関係\nChara Aは、ざっくり言うとChara Bの上司。キャラAはキャラBの命の恩人なので、キャラBはキャラAの言うことは聞きます。しかし、Chara BはChara Aに苛立ちを覚え、時には口論になることもある。しかし、Chara BはそんなChara Aに苛立ちを感じ、口論になることもある。\n\nフルメタルアルケミストで言えば、ロイとライザみたいな関係ですね。パートナーなんです。しかし、恋愛関係にはない。\n\n構成はお任せします。もし、依頼内容に問題があれば、遠慮なくお断りください。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/229418hcw4kr", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@7kmr_GA/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2558951, "client_id": 1219396, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8970bb10/uploads/origins/cfffdce4-3671-41ae-bbed-955e253d6d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd21e64350716b06596d2648655edfd0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8970bb10/uploads/origins/cfffdce4-3671-41ae-bbed-955e253d6d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd21e64350716b06596d2648655edfd0, https://si.imgix.net/8970bb10/uploads/origins/cfffdce4-3671-41ae-bbed-955e253d6d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eede671c5713726e57e573b2525202d1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8970bb10/uploads/origins/cfffdce4-3671-41ae-bbed-955e253d6d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad352b456a188e20f431f109d119fd7f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8970bb10/uploads/origins/cfffdce4-3671-41ae-bbed-955e253d6d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=804652a684cb81206e8e7dd34b0d66d4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8970bb10/uploads/origins/cfffdce4-3671-41ae-bbed-955e253d6d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=804652a684cb81206e8e7dd34b0d66d4, https://si.imgix.net/8970bb10/uploads/origins/cfffdce4-3671-41ae-bbed-955e253d6d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a508814c3007aaef69bda45adab0273 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8970bb10/uploads/origins/cfffdce4-3671-41ae-bbed-955e253d6d86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a49faab93f801c1838f9ce7f542d4375 3x"}, "body": "Hello sensei, I would like to request another illustration! The other one was so beautiful! May I request Yingfei again but with a different character?\n\n1: Yingfei: A wealthy and beautiful young man who is always smiling. He is very clever and selfish even though he looks polite. He is also very spoiled and lazy too because of his upbringing. \n2: Juju: A reserved and kind girl who used to be quite cowardly. She has grown to be someone who is more quietly confident. Juju is from a clan that can exorcise spirits and ghosts. Having overcome her childhood fears, Juju travels around the world to help spirits and ghosts. While she is not the best at talking or comforting others, she is very good at listening. \n\nTheir relationship: Juju and Yingfei are classmates. When they were children, they traveled together with 20 other kids. Though Juju and Yingfei are not super close, they do not have a bad relationship. They are tied together by their shared experiences in “YICHAN,” the exchange program they joined.\n\nSetting: Juju often wanders around and just so happens to visit the Wu Clan. While Yingfei is spoiled and lazy, he does welcome Juju to his home as a guest. Nostalgia is very powerful after all. (It helps that Yingfei knows that Juju is kind enough to purify his home thoroughly). \n\nPossible concepts include them in a snow setting (indoors or outdoors), on a bridge overlooking water lilies, doing calligraphy and drinking tea together, or attending a lantern festival. I included other inspiration in the link! Sensei can choose any of the prompt or come up with something different! Feel free to alter their designs too!!\n\n🎐 Other themes: drizzling rain, warm tea, gentle wind chimes, calligraphy and the first snow in winter.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21nrpf3cmdy?edit=1", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@7kmr_GA/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2558951, "client_id": 1219396, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a56f7e5/uploads/origins/2b498579-1664-4f4c-8ce7-3e8b4a7bae06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c7315a1816fcf74bfd06578d8e62704", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2a56f7e5/uploads/origins/2b498579-1664-4f4c-8ce7-3e8b4a7bae06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c7315a1816fcf74bfd06578d8e62704, https://si.imgix.net/2a56f7e5/uploads/origins/2b498579-1664-4f4c-8ce7-3e8b4a7bae06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53b379e7edb450b24eb81aacca68028d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2a56f7e5/uploads/origins/2b498579-1664-4f4c-8ce7-3e8b4a7bae06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28b6de4ed2a8a14d10097fd2d3b5c9d3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a56f7e5/uploads/origins/2b498579-1664-4f4c-8ce7-3e8b4a7bae06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7b9f5b28eb6ecb7e0da7943dff176349", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2a56f7e5/uploads/origins/2b498579-1664-4f4c-8ce7-3e8b4a7bae06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7b9f5b28eb6ecb7e0da7943dff176349, https://si.imgix.net/2a56f7e5/uploads/origins/2b498579-1664-4f4c-8ce7-3e8b4a7bae06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4054d9fb283eed0dbfc31cbe23f77572 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2a56f7e5/uploads/origins/2b498579-1664-4f4c-8ce7-3e8b4a7bae06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=62a1e54753555c518ba2f8c84474c88f 3x"}, "body": "Hello sensei, your art is so beautiful! \n\nMay I request 2 characters?\n\nCharacter 1 (Jade Crow): A boy who used to live on the streets before getting hired by Yingfei (2). He is very cynical and reserved because he saw how cruel humans are. He is polite on the surface and smiles easily, but is a short-tempered man inside. Please draw him in clothes A (first image in the reference.)\n\nCharacter 2 (Yingfei): A wealthy and beautiful young man who is always smiling. He is very clever and selfish even though he looks polite. He is also very spoiled and lazy too because of his upbringing. \n\nRelationship: Character 1, Jade Crow, is a vigilante hired by Character 2 (Yingfei), a wealthy young man, to do odd jobs for him. Jade (1) dislikes Yingfei’s sly and arrogant nature, but he helps him because he is poor. Ying Fei (2) likes to tease Jade (1). They are both very competitive with each other and like to banter (with words) a lot, though usually Jade gets annoyed and leaves Yingfei. \n\nThe setting is Ancient China. Themes include crows (or birds), lilies and lily pads, liquor, jewelry, leaves, nighttime, and water. I can list a couple of ideas, but sensei can decide freely what to draw! They could be on a boat ride surrounded by water lilies; Jade would be rowing and Yingfei would be sitting there drinking tea. They could be on a bridge looking at the river beneath them. They could be attending a lantern festival but only watching from afar as lanterns fly up.  Here is a link to more inspiration: https://www.pinterest.com/hanamiicchi/jade-crow-yingfei/\n\nFeel free to appeal or cancel if inappropriate. Thank you!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2nhff2do55?edit=1", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 23599, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "丼＠COMITIA東4D39b", "screen_name": "don525", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1578134079501107201/H6ujmSAQ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/33066212/1575219924/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 2130670, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "槇島", "screen_name": "xx0ffire", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019253141120905223/9MbVgLS3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1364504257374822400/1690577731/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 177}, {"id": 2247458, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ザリガニ", "screen_name": "zariganihouse", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1462799198722850821/YGplieqb.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1069088190777061377/1740226590/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_ra